# An Officer and a Pirate (abyssea 168), the reply kind: a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with the quest accepted, its
# story quests before it and the three set quests completed (GMs: their offers would tie). Joachim: 334, finished:
# completed, Heart of Madness accepted. Heart of Madness back to available and the quest back to accepted (GMs): Joachim
# again: 334 again. Joachim has his own onTrigger (xi.abyssea.traverserNPCOnTrigger): an Event-rank 334 would alternate
# with it (interaction_lookup.lua's UseFallback) and the second talk would go to his script (his 328: Dawn of Death
# accepted or completed).
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onEventFinish/334
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-51.344,0,-9.978 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons completed
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath completed
quest Abyssea.FirstContact completed
quest Abyssea.AnOfficerAndAPirate accepted
quest Abyssea.HeroesOfAbyssea completed
quest Abyssea.ScarsOfAbyssea completed
quest Abyssea.TheForbiddenFrontier completed
login
trigger Joachim                         # 334
finish                                  # completed; Heart of Madness accepted
quest Abyssea.HeartOfMadness available  # a GM
quest Abyssea.AnOfficerAndAPirate available # a GM
quest Abyssea.AnOfficerAndAPirate accepted # a GM
trigger Joachim                         # 334 again (the kind)
finish                                  # completed again
